<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! sense.scratch.dissolves ~ idempotent removal: already gone reads ok

`lares sensorium dissolve <id>` removes one scratch sensorium; `all=true` every live one; `orphans=true` reaps the orphans alone. An instance already gone answers ok.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ one · all · orphans

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`one` params=`id/s-1 ~ dissolve one sensorium`>>
<<has entity=`example` name=`all` params=`all/true ~ dissolve every live sensorium`>>
<<has entity=`example` name=`orphans` params=`orphans/true ~ reap the orphans`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ id · all · orphans

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`id` params=`takes/id needs/one-of:id,all,orphans seat/1 as/<id> ~ the sensorium to dissolve`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`all` params=`kind/switch needs/one-of:id,all,orphans ~ dissolve every live sensorium`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`orphans` params=`kind/switch needs/one-of:id,all,orphans ~ reap the orphans alone`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ local

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`local` params=`who/seat-or-hand ~ works this host's scratch sensoria under the cache; this handler checks no ocap`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ usage

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`usage` params=`cure/[[sense.scratch.dissolves id/s-1]] ~ name an id, all=true or orphans=true`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ dissolved

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`dissolved` params=`exit/0 fields/[[mode scope]] ~ what left; already gone reads ok`>>
```

